   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mark on You**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Guys on Every Corner**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **The Window Song**: back after 103 archived shows (1770 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Running Away with What Freud Said**: back after 30 archived shows (366 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Solomon Revisited**: back after 126 archived shows (2158 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Choked Out**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **This Year**: with Pool Kids [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2022-09-22** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 97 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Pool Kids [1]\n- Stage talk about: Diaz setlist presence, Guys marketing stunt, No Children, prophetic song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2022-09-22**: taped by me; transferred by me; source: CA-14 Omni (Healy Onstage) > CA-Ugly > PCM A10 + SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston] > PCM A10 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by The Orange Peel: [The Mountain Goats Tickets | 22nd September](https://www.ashevillestage.com/events/the-mountain-goats-2/) [3]",
